      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl">SSIM believes talent should never be held back by finances. We offer generous merit-based and category-specific scholarships.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">At SSIM, we are committed to making quality management education accessible to every deserving student. Our scholarship programs reward academic merit, entrance exam performance, and social diversity.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">Scholarships are awarded at the time of admission and deducted directly from the program fee. Apply early to maximise your scholarship eligibility.</p>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gold-pale border border-gold/30 border-l-4 border-l-gold rounded-lg p-4 mb-5">
          <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">🎓</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="block text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-1">Apply Early — Scholarship Seats are Limited</strong>
            <span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-500">Contact our admissions team to know your scholarship eligibility before applying.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#lead-form" class="inline-block bg-ssred hover:bg-ssred-dark text-white font-bold px-5 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors">Check Your Scholarship →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 reveal">
        <div class="scholar-accent bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-4 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
          <div class="min-w-[58px] h-14 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-[10px] leading-none">UP TO</span><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-xl leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-gold-light/70 text-[8px] font-semibold">FEE WAIVER</span></div>
          <div><h4 class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-navy mb-1">Director's Merit Scholarship</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Awarded to top-ranking CAT/XAT scorers. Covers up to 100% of tuition fees.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center mt-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/25 text-amber-700 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">🏆 Highest Academic Merit</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scholar-accent bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-4 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
          <div class="min-w-[58px] h-14 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-xl leading-none">50%</span><span class="text-gold-light/70 text-[8px] font-semibold">FEE WAIVER</span></div>
          <div><h4 class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-navy mb-1">CAT / MAT / XAT Score Scholarship</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Students with CAT 70%ile+ are eligible. Higher the score, higher the scholarship.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center mt-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/25 text-amber-700 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">📊 Entrance Exam Based</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scholar-accent bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-4 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
          <div class="min-w-[58px] h-14 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-[10px] leading-none">UP TO</span><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-xl leading-none">40%</span><span class="text-gold-light/70 text-[8px] font-semibold">FEE WAIVER</span></div>
          <div><h4 class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-navy mb-1">Academic Excellence Scholarship</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">For graduates with 75%+ marks in undergraduate degree.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center mt-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/25 text-amber-700 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">📚 Graduation Score Based</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scholar-accent bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-4 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
          <div class="min-w-[58px] h-14 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-[10px] leading-none">UP TO</span><span class="text-gold-light font-display font-black text-xl leading-none">30%</span><span class="text-gold-light/70 text-[8px] font-semibold">FEE WAIVER</span></div>
          <div><h4 class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-navy mb-1">Women Empowerment Scholarship</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Special scholarship for female candidates promoting gender diversity in management.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center mt-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/25 text-amber-700 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">👩 Diversity &amp; Inclusion</span></div>
        </div>
