          <div><h4 class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-navy mb-1">Defence / Govt Employee Ward Scholarship</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Special concession for children of defence personnel and government employees.</p><span class="inline-flex items-center mt-2 bg-gold/10 border border-gold/25 text-amber-700 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">🇮🇳 Service Category</span></div>
